{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"setRichMediaColorScheme:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setRichMediaColorScheme:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)PWMedia(cm)setRichMediaColorScheme:","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setRichMediaColorScheme:"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the color scheme reported to Rich Media content."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"setRichMediaColorScheme:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"PWRichMediaColorScheme","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWRichMediaColorScheme","preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@PWRichMediaColorScheme","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"colorScheme","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The color scheme to use."}]}],"name":"colorScheme"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich Media content reads the scheme through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"prefers-color-scheme"},{"text":" CSS media query.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The SDK never recolors content itself: a campaign without a dark variant stays light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"regardless of this setting.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PWRichMediaColorSchemeApp"},{"type":"text","text":" follow